        "evidence_id": "E001",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "In an action to recover damages for personal injuries, the defendants appeal from an order of the Supreme Court, Kings County (Schack, J.), dated February 1, 2016, which denied their motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint.",
